  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can rally the hearts of your people - even after they have stopped beating.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Death sphere (Master’s Presence), War sphere; or Death sphere, War sphere (Hallowed/Unhallowed Totem (totem)).</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> As a free action, you can shift concentration of a single active totem to an undead you control (using your concentration modifier); if its concentration is broken, the totem is ended as normal. In addition, undead you control can benefit from morale bonuses granted by your totems and rallies.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/death#toc115\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
